.IP \[bu] 2
improve: output-open failure messages are harmonized and now include the
offending filename (for instance \f[V]--alnout\f[R], \f[V]--samout\f[R],
\f[V]--uc\f[R], \f[V]--clusters\f[R]) (PR #652).
.IP \[bu] 2
improve: building no longer requires \f[V]./autogen.sh\f[R] or the
autotools; the generated build files are committed and authoritative
(maintainer mode disabled), so an ordinary build needs only a C++
compiler and make (PR #648).
.IP \[bu] 2
improve: recommend \f[V]-O3\f[R] again now that the SIMD-aligner
strict-aliasing miscompile (issue #589) is fixed at the root and the
\f[V]-fno-tree-partial-pre\f[R] workaround is removed (PR #649).
.IP \[bu] 2
improve: a documentation audit of the whole manual, correcting the
per-command pages against measured behaviour: the actual
